ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
  [x] Surface renders every web-source state: resolved-content (focusable "?" trigger + hover/focus ToolTip text
      reveal); empty (web `if (!resolved) return null` -> the surface collapses to nothing, never a blank box); the
      3 size tiers (xs/sm/md -> 12/14/16 px glyph); the 4 placements (top/bottom/left/right mapped to PlacementMode
      + FlyoutPlacementMode); and the optional learn-more link (interactive light-dismiss Flyout + HyperlinkButton,
      since a non-interactive WinUI ToolTip cannot host a clickable link). The web source is synchronous i18n-only
      (no fetch / no query), so there is NO loading/error/stale/offline chrome to reproduce -- documented in the
      view + model XML docs, matching the InlineCallout/CopyLinkButton presentational-surface pattern.
  [x] Binds via the shared i18n facade (ILocalizer, P1/S10) through the pure HelpTooltipProjection; the view does
      no HTTP (the web component's only data source is useTranslation).
  [x] i18n: both web keys resolve through P1/S10 and already exist in Strings/en|ar|he/Resources.resw --
      translation.help.tooltip.iconLabel="More info" and translation.common.learnMore="Learn more". No new keys
      required; key parity asserted in tests.
  [x] Accessibility: the trigger Button carries the localized accessible name ("More info" / caller override) plus
      the resolved help text as HelpText (web role="tooltip" + aria-describedby); decorative glyphs are
      AccessibilityView.Raw (web aria-hidden); the learn-more HyperlinkButton is a named, focusable link whose
      NavigateUri opens the system browser (web target="_blank"); the FontIcon trigger honours the system font
      scale; the popups inherit the Fluent reduced-motion behaviour.
  [x] Tests: pure-projection adapter tests + per-state projection tests (text/key/key-over-text precedence, the
      four empty paths, size x3, placement x4, learn-more default/override/localized) + accessible-name
      default/override/localized + diagnostics + argument guards. HelpTooltipTests = 30 [Fact] + 3 [Theory]
      (10 [InlineData] rows) = 40 cases, all green within the 24676 total.
